{"text":"We would like to see a time when enough is enough and Africans are equal partners and does not rely on aid to the extent that it does today. The second thing that we all agree on is that African governments have to be front and center on the development agenda for the African continent. It doesn't matter if Western policymakers or celebrities or individuals or even African individuals like myself care about economic development. If African governments are not on board, we cannot expect that the situation will turn itself around. And this is critical because somehow people think that we can get development going in Africa without the African governments if we somehow just do good and approach things in our own way. Well, that's not going to happen. We need to get African governments involved and incentivized to do the right thing.","words":[{"text":"We","start":0.0,"end":0.36},{"text":"would","start":0.36,"end":0.5},{"text":"like","start":0.5,"end":0.76},{"text":"to","start":0.76,"end":0.96},{"text":"see","start":0.96,"end":1.2},{"text":"a","start":1.2,"end":1.3},{"text":"time","start":1.3,"end":1.54},{"text":"when","start":1.54,"end":1.82},{"text":"enough","start":1.82,"end":2.3},{"text":"is","start":2.3,"end":2.48},{"text":"enough","start":2.48,"end":2.84},{"text":"and","start":2.84,"end":5.06},{"text":"Africans","start":5.06,"end":5.62},{"text":"are","start":5.62,"end":5.9},{"text":"equal","start":5.9,"end":6.16},{"text":"partners","start":6.16,"end":6.6},{"text":"and","start":6.6,"end":6.88},{"text":"does","start":6.88,"end":7.12},{"text":"not","start":7.12,"end":7.28},{"text":"rely","start":7.28,"end":7.5},{"text":"on","start":7.5,"end":7.68},{"text":"aid","start":7.68,"end":7.86},{"text":"to","start":7.86,"end":8.26},{"text":"the","start":8.26,"end":8.4},{"text":"extent","start":8.4,"end":8.58},{"text":"that","start":8.58,"end":8.78},{"text":"it","start":8.78,"end":8.88},{"text":"does","start":8.88,"end":9.06},{"text":"today","start":9.06,"end":9.44,"p